message: "If you use ilang-research, please cite it as below."
title: "I-Lang Research: the source of research.ilang.ai"
abstract: >-
  The site of I-Lang Research, the research division of iLang Inc., Canada,
  published at research.ilang.ai. It collects the protocol papers, datasets,
  open-source records and archive pages behind the I-Lang protocol. Built with
  Hugo and the PaperMod theme and deployed on Cloudflare Pages.
